WEBVTT

01:12.900 --> 01:18.580
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.020 --> 01:23.780
[Episode 23]

01:30.904 --> 01:32.704
Slow down.

01:37.104 --> 01:38.143
Or let me do it.

01:38.144 --> 01:39.144
No.

01:39.344 --> 01:40.104
Go boil the broccoli.

01:40.104 --> 01:41.104
The water is boiling.

01:41.504 --> 01:43.024
So clumsy.

01:43.024 --> 01:44.104
It won't spread out.

01:47.704 --> 01:49.304
Granny, you're up.

01:50.224 --> 01:51.943
What to eat this morning?

01:51.944 --> 01:53.264
Creamed Soybean and steamed buns.

01:54.984 --> 01:58.663
It's inappropriate
not to call others in the Yard.

01:58.664 --> 02:00.504
What? It's itching.

02:01.104 --> 02:02.863
Understand the situation.

02:02.864 --> 02:04.624
Give up fantasy.

02:05.584 --> 02:05.904
Granny.

02:05.904 --> 02:07.264
What do "Understand the situation"

02:07.264 --> 02:08.544
and "Give up fantasy" mean?

02:09.064 --> 02:11.903
That's what Yao told me yesterday.

02:11.904 --> 02:13.183
Granny.

02:13.184 --> 02:14.223
Didn't you wash your face?

02:14.224 --> 02:14.744
Wash before eating.

02:14.744 --> 02:16.503
I washed it.

02:16.504 --> 02:17.903
Why is there gum in your eyes?

02:17.904 --> 02:19.903
You're the one who has gum in your eyes.

02:19.904 --> 02:22.463
When he was young, he ate his eye gum.

02:22.464 --> 02:23.184
Granny.

02:23.184 --> 02:24.024
I beg you.

02:24.024 --> 02:25.304
Help.

02:25.944 --> 02:26.903
All right.

02:26.904 --> 02:27.264
Go.

02:27.264 --> 02:27.944
I'll leave you alone.

02:27.944 --> 02:28.424
Okay.

02:28.424 --> 02:30.544
Go.

02:31.104 --> 02:32.424
One latte and one orange juice.

02:32.424 --> 02:33.624
A boletus pancake.

02:33.624 --> 02:34.984
A truffle, right?

02:36.024 --> 02:36.943
Okay, just a moment, please.

02:36.944 --> 02:37.944
Thank you.

03:01.904 --> 03:03.864
How about this one?

03:14.184 --> 03:15.184
Really...

03:15.384 --> 03:16.703
I got an upset stomach.

03:16.704 --> 03:18.664
I shouldn't have drunk
that cold tea just now.

03:19.904 --> 03:21.823
Why don't you go back and rest first?

03:21.824 --> 03:22.904
There are not many guests today.

03:22.904 --> 03:24.264
I can handle it alone.

03:25.024 --> 03:26.024
It's okay.

03:26.384 --> 03:27.504
I'll be better with a cup of hot water.

03:27.504 --> 03:28.783
Xiaochun is not here.

03:28.784 --> 03:29.784
I'll help you.

03:31.384 --> 03:32.664
It's really moving.

03:33.064 --> 03:33.944
Then take a rest.

03:33.944 --> 03:35.224
I'll give you a cup of hot water.

03:44.024 --> 03:45.024
Thank you.

03:49.064 --> 03:50.104
By the way, Hongdou.

03:50.544 --> 03:53.544
Xiaochun continues
to introduce girls to Mr. Xie.

03:59.664 --> 04:00.744
What kind of girls?

04:02.584 --> 04:04.663
A new creative restaurant opened in the town.

04:04.664 --> 04:07.183
A female boss with curly hair.

04:07.184 --> 04:09.944
The feeling of Hong Kong female stars in 1980s.

04:11.104 --> 04:12.304
Curly hair.

04:14.464 --> 04:15.663
Like Wang Zuxian?

04:15.664 --> 04:16.543
Yeah.

04:16.544 --> 04:18.504
Really fashionable and pretty.

04:20.944 --> 04:22.904
But Mr. Xie refused.

04:24.664 --> 04:25.664
Refused.

04:33.664 --> 04:34.664
Hongdou.

04:35.704 --> 04:37.424
What's your ex-boyfriend like?

04:37.824 --> 04:38.824
Handsome or not?

04:41.744 --> 04:42.743
Kind of handsome.

04:42.744 --> 04:43.744
He's tall.

04:45.544 --> 04:48.504
My sister said that he was
blind to being in love with me.

04:50.984 --> 04:52.264
Then why did you break up?

04:52.704 --> 04:53.983
We rarely met.

04:53.984 --> 04:55.024
The feelings faded.

04:55.904 --> 04:58.664
How busy were you
not to meet each other?

05:01.424 --> 05:02.704
We lived too far away.

05:03.384 --> 05:04.104
I'm on the East Fourth Ring Road.

05:04.104 --> 05:05.343
He is on the West Fifth Ring Road.

05:05.344 --> 05:07.824
It's a long trip by subway to see each other.

05:08.184 --> 05:09.184
My sister said that

05:10.104 --> 05:11.544
long-distance love has no good results.

05:12.544 --> 05:15.544
Your sister is really a national expert
on throwing cold water.

05:16.984 --> 05:20.384
Jia Baoyu was born with jade in his mouth.

05:21.984 --> 05:23.544
My sister was born with a blade.

05:26.184 --> 05:27.623
When I return to Shanghai,

05:27.624 --> 05:30.384
I must sneak to your sister's company

05:30.664 --> 05:32.904
to see what exactly she looks like.

05:44.824 --> 05:46.464
I'm really dazzled.

05:47.064 --> 05:48.624
Everyone looks like my sister.

05:50.624 --> 05:51.624
Does she?

05:51.944 --> 05:52.944
A little.

05:53.544 --> 05:56.744
Maybe the lady's temperament is all similar.

06:04.264 --> 06:05.264
Mom.

06:06.384 --> 06:10.264
I feel that person looks
a little like my aunt.

06:10.784 --> 06:11.903
Are you finished?

06:11.904 --> 06:13.744
Yes, I won.

06:14.224 --> 06:15.463
Great.

06:15.464 --> 06:17.024
Then go to see if it's your aunt.

06:24.144 --> 06:25.624
Aunt.

06:27.024 --> 06:28.024
Lingdang?

06:29.424 --> 06:31.063
Lingdang?

06:31.064 --> 06:32.543
Aunt.

06:32.544 --> 06:34.583
Why are you here, Lingdang?

06:34.584 --> 06:35.424
Mom.

06:35.424 --> 06:37.624
It's really my aunt.

06:59.184 --> 07:00.184
Fatter.

07:03.224 --> 07:04.224
Darker.

07:05.104 --> 07:06.544
You really know how to greet.

07:06.944 --> 07:08.144
Thank you for your praise.

07:09.424 --> 07:10.784
Why did you come suddenly?

07:11.384 --> 07:12.704
To surprise you.

07:13.184 --> 07:15.264
You should have told me.

07:15.504 --> 07:17.343
I could send someone to pick you up.

07:17.344 --> 07:17.624
No.

07:17.624 --> 07:19.664
There is a shuttle service in that homestay.

07:19.984 --> 07:21.104
The homestay in the town?

07:28.704 --> 07:30.184
Can you stop playing mobile phone?

07:30.784 --> 07:31.584
I'm working.

07:31.584 --> 07:32.624
I'm not playing.

07:32.624 --> 07:33.624
Wait, almost done.

07:34.824 --> 07:36.503
Give it to me in half an hour.

07:36.504 --> 07:37.504
Okay?

07:40.344 --> 07:41.344
Waitress.

07:41.904 --> 07:42.944
The coffee is cold.

07:44.104 --> 07:45.384
Waitress.

07:48.104 --> 07:49.423
Not bad.

07:49.424 --> 07:51.224
You took volunteering seriously.

07:51.664 --> 07:52.664
When will you go back?

07:54.664 --> 07:55.824
The holiday is not over yet.

07:58.024 --> 08:00.664
Honesty is the foundation of all virtues.

08:01.344 --> 08:02.984
I called your hotel.

08:03.344 --> 08:05.024
Your hotel said you resigned.

08:05.824 --> 08:07.984
How dare you lie to parents
that you got three months off?

08:07.984 --> 08:09.464
I knew you had a problem.

08:11.184 --> 08:12.343
I'm afraid that

08:12.344 --> 08:14.184
if parents know I resigned, they'll be worried.

08:15.344 --> 08:16.864
I want to tell them when I go back.

08:18.464 --> 08:19.464
Why resign?

08:21.504 --> 08:22.624
I don't want to do it.

08:23.624 --> 08:25.104
Then what do you want to do?

08:26.064 --> 08:27.064
Rest.

08:28.584 --> 08:30.344
Even if I'm a part,

08:31.544 --> 08:33.144
I need maintenance.

08:33.984 --> 08:35.104
Have you got enough rest?

08:35.384 --> 08:36.424
Is maintenance enough?

08:36.784 --> 08:37.984
What's your plan?

08:38.264 --> 08:39.903
I was good.

08:39.904 --> 08:42.424
When you ask me,
you bring me back to work immediately.

08:42.864 --> 08:43.824
Leader's speech.

08:43.824 --> 08:45.624
Asking me about the arrangements
for the next quarter.

08:46.344 --> 08:48.104
You got angry about a question.

08:48.504 --> 08:49.504
Not angry.

08:49.824 --> 08:50.824
All right. I'll stop.

08:53.544 --> 08:55.384
Aunt, have a bite?

08:58.504 --> 08:59.504
No, thanks.

09:04.024 --> 09:06.064
I'll take you to eat
delicious braised chicken later.

09:06.064 --> 09:06.504
Okay?

09:06.504 --> 09:06.784
Take you and Mom...

09:06.784 --> 09:08.104
I don't want chicken.

09:09.864 --> 09:10.864
Okay.

09:11.944 --> 09:15.103
I have an important video conference tonight.

09:15.104 --> 09:16.664
It will take a long time.

09:17.544 --> 09:18.903
I can't have dinner with you.

09:18.904 --> 09:20.103
Take her with you.

09:20.104 --> 09:21.104
Okay.

09:21.184 --> 09:23.343
I'll take her to dinner
and take her back to you.

09:23.344 --> 09:24.240
No.

09:24.264 --> 09:25.343
Let her sleep with you tonight.

09:25.344 --> 09:27.424
Here is her baggage.

09:29.344 --> 09:30.343
Sleep with me?

09:30.344 --> 09:31.344
Happy?

09:32.464 --> 09:33.264
I want to sleep with you.

09:33.264 --> 09:34.663
I want to sleep with you, Aunt.

09:34.664 --> 09:37.184
Sleep with Aunt these days.

09:37.824 --> 09:40.144
You finally find someone
to help you with your child.

09:41.024 --> 09:42.463
If you don't look after your niece,

09:42.464 --> 09:44.263
who else would you look after?

09:44.264 --> 09:45.264
Alright.

09:47.424 --> 09:48.424
Lingdang.

09:49.104 --> 09:50.104
Listen to Aunt.

09:50.104 --> 09:51.144
Don't run about.

09:51.984 --> 09:53.504
Don't casually feed her, okay?

09:53.504 --> 09:54.343
Please.

09:54.344 --> 09:55.384
Got it.

09:56.664 --> 09:57.664
Okay.

09:58.704 --> 10:00.664
Mom is going to leave now.

10:01.184 --> 10:02.503
Bye, Mom.

10:02.504 --> 10:03.864
Goodbye.

10:06.624 --> 10:09.864
Your little coffee sister has
been taking pictures of us.

10:09.864 --> 10:11.144
Your mobile phone keeps shaking.

10:11.144 --> 10:12.223
I tell you.

10:12.224 --> 10:13.543
Don't speak ill of me.

10:13.544 --> 10:15.784
Otherwise, the consequences will be serious.

10:19.624 --> 10:20.624
Goodbye.

10:29.184 --> 10:33.624
[Hongdou's sister suddenly came
with her daughter! Hongdou is in danger!]

10:33.624 --> 10:37.544
[The legendary Xu Hongmi. Indeed domineering!]

10:37.544 --> 10:40.984
[It's my type.]

10:40.984 --> 10:42.984
[It's your fantasy.]

10:42.984 --> 10:44.104
[Does she like milk tea?]

10:44.104 --> 10:45.704
[What are you doing, Mr. Ma?]

10:45.704 --> 10:46.824
[In a meeting.]

10:46.824 --> 10:48.024
[Anyone wants to see the dog?]

10:48.024 --> 10:48.504
[No!]

10:48.504 --> 10:49.984
[Who's the girl named Huang?]

10:49.984 --> 10:51.984
[Who invited Huang to this group?]

10:51.984 --> 10:55.744
[Hey, successfully got inside.]

10:55.744 --> 10:59.984
[What does Hongdou's sister do?
Could she give us any resources?]

10:59.984 --> 11:02.423
[Right, what resources could she give me?]

11:02.424 --> 11:04.104
[Who can kick this businessman out?]

11:04.104 --> 11:06.024
[@Xie Zhiyao]

11:08.864 --> 11:10.103
What would you like for dinner?

11:10.104 --> 11:11.224
Maoduoli.

11:11.744 --> 11:12.864
Maoduoli?

11:13.344 --> 11:14.344
What is it?

11:18.784 --> 11:22.224
Maoduoli.

11:22.864 --> 11:23.864
Maoduoli.

11:25.224 --> 11:26.624
Do you want to eat Maoduoli?

11:35.824 --> 11:37.264
You can't take it as a meal.

11:37.904 --> 11:39.863
Tamarind cake. Haven't you eaten it?

11:39.864 --> 11:40.864
No.

11:43.344 --> 11:44.384
Have a taste.

11:59.704 --> 12:01.423
Why did your sister come suddenly?

12:01.424 --> 12:03.344
Who knows what's wrong with her?

12:04.424 --> 12:05.664
She may know that I resigned.

12:05.664 --> 12:07.224
And she wants me to work in Shanghai.

12:09.584 --> 12:10.944
Where do you want to work?

12:12.344 --> 12:13.344
Back to Beijing.

12:13.664 --> 12:14.664
Decided?

12:18.544 --> 12:20.624
I've lived in Beijing
for more than ten years.

12:21.184 --> 12:22.824
The air in Shanghai,

12:23.064 --> 12:24.064
and the taste.

12:24.544 --> 12:25.984
I have to adapt to those again.

12:26.384 --> 12:27.464
Why not go back to Beijing?

12:28.824 --> 12:29.824
Then,

12:29.864 --> 12:31.504
do you find the life you want?

12:32.344 --> 12:33.863
Now we can only use the exclusion method.

12:33.864 --> 12:34.944
Exclude the unwanted.

12:36.144 --> 12:37.504
It's also a way.

12:38.544 --> 12:40.183
When I was in Beijing before,

12:40.184 --> 12:42.504
I really liked to go riding in Huairou.

12:42.784 --> 12:45.063
Getting along with horses away from buildings,

12:45.064 --> 12:46.504
It's easier to calm down.

12:48.584 --> 12:49.664
Didn't you date?

12:50.384 --> 12:51.344
I had no date.

12:51.344 --> 12:52.904
After graduation,
I have no girlfriend.

12:53.464 --> 12:54.464
Why?

12:55.064 --> 12:57.063
In my department,
there were more male colleagues.

12:57.064 --> 12:59.744
The female colleagues were
either married or not single.

13:03.104 --> 13:03.784
No, I mean.

13:03.784 --> 13:06.344
Why did you have no girlfriend after graduation?

13:08.344 --> 13:09.344
Well,

13:09.424 --> 13:11.624
that girl went to
Shenzhen later.

13:12.224 --> 13:15.024
And my own life planning
was to work for a few years,

13:15.024 --> 13:17.104
save some money and experience,
and return home.

13:17.384 --> 13:18.943
Even if some girls liked me,

13:18.944 --> 13:21.984
when they heard my life planning,
basically, they gave up.

13:28.864 --> 13:29.864
Then,

13:30.504 --> 13:32.784
when were you in love last time?

13:38.184 --> 13:39.704
Five or six years ago.

13:41.664 --> 13:43.224
Has there been no pursuer since then?

13:44.184 --> 13:47.144
Either colleagues or customers.

13:47.584 --> 13:48.584
Troublesome.

13:48.984 --> 13:50.904
Actually,
the point is you haven't met anyone you like.

13:56.744 --> 13:58.704
Do you have high standards?

14:01.264 --> 14:02.264
No.

14:02.504 --> 14:03.904
As long as I like him.

14:05.384 --> 14:07.544
What about the money,
the car, the house,

14:07.544 --> 14:09.224
family conditions,
and the economic conditions?

14:09.784 --> 14:10.983
It's better if he has them.

14:10.984 --> 14:12.423
It's okay if he doesn't.

14:12.424 --> 14:13.944
Just be aspirant.

14:15.344 --> 14:17.543
It's harder to find someone
without any requirements, you know?

14:17.544 --> 14:18.544
Really?

14:30.784 --> 14:33.624
Where do you want to take your sister
and Lingdang to go tomorrow?

14:34.344 --> 14:35.183
Lingdang.

14:35.184 --> 14:36.464
Where do you want to play tomorrow?

14:36.464 --> 14:38.023
I want to see the pony.

14:38.024 --> 14:39.104
The pony.

14:39.664 --> 14:41.064
Uncle was also there.

14:41.944 --> 14:44.024
The pony delivered by Uncle?

14:44.704 --> 14:45.223
Okay.

14:45.224 --> 14:46.984
I'll take you to see the pony tomorrow.

14:49.264 --> 14:50.264
Aren't you busy?

14:51.384 --> 14:53.344
Your sister finally came with her kid.

14:53.344 --> 14:55.023
I think driving is convenient.

14:55.024 --> 14:56.624
I'll be your driver and guide.

14:56.864 --> 14:59.864
Aren't you going to receive
that bookstore owner?

15:00.344 --> 15:02.184
Actually, it's basically arranged.

15:02.184 --> 15:04.063
And I don't know
when they would come.

15:04.064 --> 15:05.424
Don't worry, I'm free tomorrow.

15:06.024 --> 15:07.024
Okay.

15:09.224 --> 15:10.224
To see the pony.

15:14.464 --> 15:16.504
Hey, we arrived. Come out.

15:23.424 --> 15:24.744
Mom.

15:27.224 --> 15:27.624
Sister.

15:27.624 --> 15:28.744
This is Xie Zhiyao.

15:28.744 --> 15:30.103
We all call him Mr. Xie.

15:30.104 --> 15:30.903
I know.

15:30.904 --> 15:32.623
Mr. Xie, the marriage seeker, right?

15:32.624 --> 15:33.863
Hello, Hongmi.

15:33.864 --> 15:34.424
Hello.

15:34.424 --> 15:35.704
Just call me Xie Zhiyao.

15:35.704 --> 15:37.424
Marriage-seeking was just joking.

15:38.144 --> 15:39.263
Sorry to bother you today.

15:39.264 --> 15:39.863
Not at all.

15:39.864 --> 15:40.504
By the way,

15:40.504 --> 15:42.823
please give valuable suggestions
for the tourist routes for our village.

15:42.824 --> 15:43.824
Get in the car.

15:43.944 --> 15:44.944
Get in.

15:52.784 --> 15:53.983
How are you?

15:53.984 --> 15:55.224
Didn't sleep well yesterday?

15:55.544 --> 15:56.263
Not good.

15:56.264 --> 15:57.624
The sound insulation was too bad.

15:57.944 --> 16:00.384
And mosquitoes and flying insects
were everywhere.

16:00.944 --> 16:02.664
And the bedding, It's too rough.

16:02.664 --> 16:03.664
Uncomfortable.

16:04.224 --> 16:06.063
This is already the best homestay here.

16:06.064 --> 16:07.064
Make do.

16:08.144 --> 16:09.144
Hongmi.

16:09.224 --> 16:11.344
Do you have any places you want to go?

16:12.504 --> 16:14.184
Are there any farms nearby?

16:14.424 --> 16:16.984
Let Lingdang know about some crops.

16:17.384 --> 16:19.104
I also want to pick plums.

16:19.104 --> 16:20.304
Okay.

16:20.984 --> 16:22.783
The organic farm your friend runs.

16:22.784 --> 16:23.864
What vegetables do they have now?

16:25.104 --> 16:26.984
Pumpkin, cucumber, tomato.

16:26.984 --> 16:27.943
Basically all.

16:27.944 --> 16:29.504
Let's have lunch there.

16:30.344 --> 16:31.824
They only serve two tables a day.

16:31.824 --> 16:33.183
I have to ask in advance.

16:33.184 --> 16:34.263
Make a reservation.

16:34.264 --> 16:35.064
Then ask.

16:35.064 --> 16:38.104
The roasted beef they make
in the self-built pizza oven

16:38.104 --> 16:38.704
is especially delicious.

16:38.704 --> 16:39.824
Okay, let me ask.

16:45.024 --> 16:46.024
Mom.

16:46.744 --> 16:48.544
Is that leek?

16:51.344 --> 16:52.623
That's wheat.

16:52.624 --> 16:54.583
What is wheat?

16:54.584 --> 16:57.624
Wheat is that steamed bun made by grandma.

16:59.504 --> 17:00.584
Xu Hongmi.

17:00.584 --> 17:02.544
Can you stop teaching casually?

17:02.824 --> 17:04.224
That's rice.

17:05.104 --> 17:06.184
Isn't that wheat?

17:06.904 --> 17:07.344
No.

17:07.344 --> 17:10.744
Here only produces the wheat corn,
and the glutinous corn.

17:10.744 --> 17:11.744
It's really delicious.

17:12.064 --> 17:12.983
Lingdang.

17:12.984 --> 17:14.263
Look what's over there.

17:14.264 --> 17:16.184
There is the rose field.

17:17.424 --> 17:18.864
Rose.

17:19.744 --> 17:22.224
The rose here looks ugly.

17:23.584 --> 17:24.343
Sister.

17:24.344 --> 17:26.383
This is the real edible rose.

17:26.384 --> 17:29.224
The rose we saw in the flower shop
is the Chinese Rose.

17:30.264 --> 17:31.264
Chinese Rose.

17:31.824 --> 17:35.183
I remember that rose
growing in grandma's house.

17:35.184 --> 17:37.864
You picked it and got beaten later,
right?

17:38.224 --> 17:40.224
What I picked was the rose in Uncle's house.

17:40.224 --> 17:43.224
The flower growing in Grandma's
house was called oleander.

17:43.464 --> 17:44.543
Really?

17:44.544 --> 17:46.744
I remember that it was the Chinese Rose.

17:54.104 --> 17:56.463
This is Lemon Balm.

17:56.464 --> 17:57.343
Smell it.

17:57.344 --> 17:58.864
Is there a cool taste?

17:59.344 --> 18:01.503
It tastes like mints.

18:01.504 --> 18:02.944
What is this?

18:03.544 --> 18:05.863
This is rose geranium.

18:05.864 --> 18:06.864
Smell it.

18:07.424 --> 18:09.344
It smells like roses.

18:10.784 --> 18:11.784
Smell this.

18:12.344 --> 18:13.464
It's rosemary.

18:15.824 --> 18:17.143
Bad smell.

18:17.144 --> 18:17.863
Alright.

18:17.864 --> 18:19.423
Then we give up the rosemary.

18:19.424 --> 18:21.384
Let's use two other
herbs to infuse and drink.

18:22.624 --> 18:24.344
Mom.

18:31.544 --> 18:32.423
It's okay.

18:32.424 --> 18:33.544
Let's see something else.

18:34.224 --> 18:34.624
Slow down.

18:34.624 --> 18:37.304
♫ Miss and hug ♫

18:37.824 --> 18:42.104
♫ Where's the breeze in the world ♫

18:42.584 --> 18:45.584
♫ Where's the hidden heartbeat ♫

18:47.384 --> 18:50.344
♫ Whose dreams to be filled ♫

18:52.104 --> 18:53.263
So icy.

18:53.264 --> 18:54.264
Icy?

18:55.224 --> 18:55.903
Come on.

18:55.904 --> 18:56.664
Take this.

18:56.664 --> 18:58.024
Take it to your mother.

18:58.384 --> 18:59.384
And this.

19:04.624 --> 19:08.144
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

19:09.664 --> 19:13.424
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

19:14.224 --> 19:17.544
♫ Like the love of youth ♫

19:17.864 --> 19:21.744
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

19:22.784 --> 19:26.384
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

19:26.864 --> 19:31.584
♫ Maybe the wish will be realized ♫

19:48.704 --> 19:49.704
What are you looking at?

19:50.224 --> 19:51.344
Look at Xu Hongmi.

19:51.344 --> 19:52.423
She's like a fool.

19:52.424 --> 19:54.023
I tell you I don't know.

19:54.024 --> 19:54.624
Anyway, you...

19:54.624 --> 19:55.864
You get it done for me.

19:56.984 --> 19:58.304
Your sister is not easy.

19:58.904 --> 20:00.104
When she takes the children out to play,

20:00.104 --> 20:01.104
she still has to work.

20:01.344 --> 20:02.864
I really don't know
what she's doing here.

20:03.624 --> 20:04.344
She worries about you.

20:04.344 --> 20:05.464
And she comes to see you.

20:07.064 --> 20:08.344
You don't know her.

20:08.784 --> 20:11.144
She's not here because
she worried about me.

20:11.664 --> 20:14.104
She came here
just to educate me.

20:15.624 --> 20:17.104
That's how you understand it.

20:18.664 --> 20:19.264
Let me tell you.

20:19.264 --> 20:20.744
We grew up together.

20:20.744 --> 20:23.904
I know best who Xu Hongmi really is.

20:24.464 --> 20:28.143
Since childhood,
she walks with vigor.

20:28.144 --> 20:29.343
Never turning back.

20:29.344 --> 20:31.383
Then I have to run all the way to follow her.

20:31.384 --> 20:32.064
But I can't keep up.

20:32.064 --> 20:33.064
She still says I'm slow.

20:35.064 --> 20:37.424
But you are really like sisters.

20:37.784 --> 20:39.424
Generally, in a family,
if there are two children,

20:39.424 --> 20:40.904
their characters are complementary.

20:41.584 --> 20:45.304
If one is tough,
the other one would be soft.

20:45.744 --> 20:48.544
If one is a little lively,
the other one would be quiet.

20:49.184 --> 20:49.824
One saves worry.

20:49.824 --> 20:50.704
The other does not.

20:50.704 --> 20:52.104
I'm the worrying one.

20:52.544 --> 20:53.784
What's the matter of worrying?

20:54.504 --> 20:55.463
No, nothing.

20:55.464 --> 20:57.144
Well, if it were you,
which one do you prefer?

20:57.864 --> 21:00.384
If it's my children, of course,
I'd love them both.

21:01.784 --> 21:02.944
I'm serious.

21:03.424 --> 21:05.744
For parents,
if the child saves worry

21:05.744 --> 21:06.623
and is outstanding in everything,

21:06.624 --> 21:08.184
of course, it's a blessing.

21:08.464 --> 21:10.904
But if the kid is troublesome,
that's normal.

21:11.464 --> 21:13.784
If you want to save worry,
why do you have babies?

21:14.064 --> 21:14.944
Human cubs

21:14.944 --> 21:17.064
are the most difficult animals
to raise in the world.

21:18.024 --> 21:19.783
The essence of the human is

21:19.784 --> 21:21.223
ambivalent and of double standards.

21:21.224 --> 21:22.103
Right?

21:22.104 --> 21:26.263
What you learned from books,
what you say, and what you do

21:26.264 --> 21:27.424
are all different things.

21:28.344 --> 21:31.744
We're just being
educated to be fair and just.

21:31.984 --> 21:34.744
But in fact,
however nice you say,

21:35.104 --> 21:37.863
finally, you will prefer the one
which meets your preferences

21:37.864 --> 21:39.223
and your aesthetic orientation.

21:39.224 --> 21:40.224
Right?

21:41.624 --> 21:42.624
Sure.

21:43.624 --> 21:45.704
We might as well
think more rationally.

21:46.144 --> 21:47.343
Who doesn't like

21:47.344 --> 21:50.184
the good-looking and excellent person
with good character?

21:50.584 --> 21:52.024
Have you heard of anyone
whose mate selection criteria

21:52.024 --> 21:54.704
is to find one who earns
less and works more,

21:54.704 --> 21:57.103
who's too busy to talk to,
stubborn,

21:57.104 --> 21:58.464
and unwilling to change himself?

21:58.864 --> 21:59.864
That's me.

22:01.424 --> 22:03.624
Your evaluation of yourself is not high.

22:04.424 --> 22:05.543
In my eyes,

22:05.544 --> 22:08.944
you are the good-looking and excellent one
with good character.

22:10.664 --> 22:11.664
You too.

22:11.784 --> 22:13.344
This consolation award,
don't give it to me.

22:13.664 --> 22:14.904
It's the truth.

22:19.464 --> 22:20.464
Go there to play?

22:23.264 --> 22:25.903
As the saying goes,
we are already here.

22:25.904 --> 22:26.464
Just be happy.

22:26.464 --> 22:27.343
Okay.

22:27.344 --> 22:28.344
Happy.

22:33.904 --> 22:34.904
I'm listening.

22:35.224 --> 22:35.544
All right.

22:35.544 --> 22:36.744
Give me the plan tonight.

22:36.744 --> 22:37.744
Okay.

22:39.864 --> 22:41.104
Does your phone still have power?

22:42.704 --> 22:43.904
Does your phone still have power?

22:44.144 --> 22:45.144
No.

22:45.984 --> 22:47.824
But I have the power bank.

22:48.544 --> 22:49.904
And there are two of them.

22:51.104 --> 22:52.104
Do you need it?

22:52.224 --> 22:53.864
I still have four-fifths of electricity.

22:54.384 --> 22:55.904
Is this the feeling of unemployment?

22:58.864 --> 23:00.143
Aunt.

23:00.144 --> 23:01.423
Dog.

23:01.424 --> 23:02.464
Dog.

23:03.624 --> 23:05.063
That's the boss's dog.

23:05.064 --> 23:06.344
It's called Pitaya.

23:06.784 --> 23:08.024
Do you want to play with it?

23:09.824 --> 23:10.623
No.

23:10.624 --> 23:11.624
Don't touch it.

23:11.984 --> 23:15.704
If caught or bitten by a dog,
you'll need an injection.

23:15.984 --> 23:17.104
You don't want it, right?

23:17.544 --> 23:19.703
And this dog didn't get deworming.

23:19.704 --> 23:22.183
Humans and dogs have different bacteria.

23:22.184 --> 23:23.184
Okay?

23:25.504 --> 23:27.223
Let's ignore Mom, the old witch.

23:27.224 --> 23:28.424
Let's play with dogs.

23:28.784 --> 23:29.784
Let's play.

23:31.424 --> 23:32.424
Take a picture of you.

23:34.344 --> 23:34.664
Hongmi.

23:34.664 --> 23:35.423
Wait a minute.

23:35.424 --> 23:36.424
You can rest assured.

23:36.704 --> 23:38.464
Pitaya is very mild.

23:38.904 --> 23:39.824
How can I rest assured?

23:39.824 --> 23:40.864
Do you have children?

23:42.184 --> 23:42.864
I have no child.

23:42.864 --> 23:43.864
But I have been a child.

23:43.864 --> 23:45.703
You should let the
child play everything

23:45.704 --> 23:46.824
and have nothing to fear.

23:47.184 --> 23:48.184
Here.

23:50.784 --> 23:51.784
It's okay.

23:52.344 --> 23:53.344
Alright.

23:53.544 --> 23:54.864
You're responsible if she's bitten.

23:55.704 --> 23:56.784
It's okay.

23:59.344 --> 24:00.544
I'll take a video for you.

24:04.424 --> 24:05.424
Look here.

24:07.064 --> 24:08.064
Xu Hongdou.

24:08.624 --> 24:10.624
Don't let it lick her hand.

24:11.024 --> 24:12.904
I'll wash it later.

24:22.904 --> 24:24.544
But it's really not clean.

24:25.064 --> 24:26.624
No wonder Mi is so anxious.

24:26.904 --> 24:29.103
Why don't she and the child play something else?

24:29.104 --> 24:31.184
She... She's the same
as when she was a child.

24:31.544 --> 24:33.304
She always likes to mess around.

24:33.944 --> 24:35.623
Before, when she went to her grandma's house,

24:35.624 --> 24:38.064
it's just like let the tiger
go back to the mountain.

24:38.744 --> 24:39.983
She is just stubborn.

24:39.984 --> 24:41.944
If you don't you let her do it,
she would do it.

24:43.544 --> 24:45.344
These years she has changed a lot.

24:45.344 --> 24:46.984
Obviously, she's calmer.

24:48.064 --> 24:49.384
One's adulthood can be seen at three years old.

24:49.704 --> 24:50.664
She's still stubborn.

24:50.664 --> 24:51.664
Refuse to listen to advice.

24:52.344 --> 24:53.464
Full of ideas.

24:55.144 --> 24:57.344
It's you who want her to go to Shanghai.

24:58.584 --> 25:00.384
Isn't it you who want
her to go to Shanghai?

25:01.104 --> 25:03.344
I want her to stay at home.

25:04.344 --> 25:05.543
Please don't.

25:05.544 --> 25:06.864
Then she would piss me off.

25:10.504 --> 25:13.143
Dou has resigned for so long.

25:13.144 --> 25:16.424
She doesn't tell the family what her plan is.

25:16.744 --> 25:18.344
As her mother,
why don't you ask her?

25:18.904 --> 25:20.744
As her father,
why don't you ask?

25:21.384 --> 25:22.864
You don't want to ask,
so you let me ask her.

25:22.864 --> 25:23.543
Right?

25:23.544 --> 25:25.143
Be the good man yourself.

25:25.144 --> 25:27.184
Did I give birth to the daughter myself?

25:27.584 --> 25:29.623
Look, once I mention this,
you are irritated.

25:29.624 --> 25:31.424
I'm discussing it with you.

25:31.664 --> 25:33.784
It doesn't sound like a tone of negotiation.

25:35.704 --> 25:36.784
All right, leader.

25:36.784 --> 25:38.504
What do you think we should do?

25:38.944 --> 25:40.183
Nothing.

25:40.184 --> 25:41.384
Since she doesn't
want to let us know.

25:41.384 --> 25:42.544
Then we don't know.

25:42.864 --> 25:44.064
Wait until she comes back.

25:45.264 --> 25:47.103
Is she your own daughter?

25:47.104 --> 25:47.903
No.

25:47.904 --> 25:49.463
I robbed her at the gate of the hospital.

25:49.464 --> 25:50.503
Look.

25:50.504 --> 25:51.343
What?

25:51.344 --> 25:53.264
I'm really making dumplings to feed pigs.

26:01.104 --> 26:04.104
You think, for Mi and Dou,
how long can they stand

26:04.104 --> 26:05.104
not to fight with each other?

26:12.664 --> 26:14.104
Two minutes.

26:25.704 --> 26:26.904
Take this and eat it.

26:34.944 --> 26:36.423
Aunt, wipe my mouth.

26:36.424 --> 26:37.063
No.

26:37.064 --> 26:38.103
Wipe after eating.

26:38.104 --> 26:38.783
Is it delicious?

26:38.784 --> 26:39.784
Delicious.

26:40.904 --> 26:45.864
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

26:48.304 --> 26:54.384
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

26:54.704 --> 26:58.184
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

26:58.184 --> 27:00.464
President Liu,
I know you have enough money.

27:02.064 --> 27:02.464
Look.

27:02.464 --> 27:03.544
We pay much attention to this project.

27:03.544 --> 27:04.783
I'm in charge of it myself.

27:04.784 --> 27:06.784
And I transferred
everyone to your project.

27:06.784 --> 27:09.503
Mom, look at the pony.

27:09.504 --> 27:10.423
Alright.

27:10.424 --> 27:11.824
Mom is busy.

27:19.024 --> 27:19.703
What?

27:19.704 --> 27:21.064
Don't be unhappy.

27:21.384 --> 27:22.943
Lingdang is not unhappy.

27:22.944 --> 27:24.624
She has used two power banks.

27:25.024 --> 27:26.543
That's all she has.

27:26.544 --> 27:27.903
Let's see what she'll do
when she runs out.

27:27.904 --> 27:30.064
My mother has two phones.

27:34.704 --> 27:35.224
It's okay.

27:35.224 --> 27:36.224
Video the pony.

27:37.344 --> 27:38.344
Look how cute the pony is.

27:39.024 --> 27:39.344
Right?

27:39.344 --> 27:44.784
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

27:47.024 --> 27:49.063
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

27:49.064 --> 27:53.464
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

27:53.704 --> 28:00.904
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

28:13.264 --> 28:15.544
[Zhang, Assistant of Mr. Liu]

28:18.504 --> 28:19.504
Hello?

28:20.104 --> 28:21.304
Hello, Assitant Zhang.

28:21.584 --> 28:22.543
Good morning.

28:22.544 --> 28:23.704
What's the matter?

28:31.944 --> 28:34.224
[Huang Xinxin]

28:37.344 --> 28:38.464
Huang. What's up?

28:42.824 --> 28:43.464
Okay.

28:43.464 --> 28:44.464
I'll be right here.

28:46.584 --> 28:47.143
Granny.

28:47.144 --> 28:48.024
I'll go to the village committee

28:48.024 --> 28:49.624
to have a meeting
with the village director and the secretary.

28:50.424 --> 28:51.424
What's the matter?

28:53.624 --> 28:54.983
About the bookstore.

28:54.984 --> 28:55.984
Bye.

28:58.264 --> 28:59.664
[Meeting Room]

28:59.664 --> 29:01.264
Why do they suddenly come here?

29:01.984 --> 29:03.944
The village hasn't organized the cleaning.

29:04.264 --> 29:06.903
He said it's Mr. Liu's private trip.

29:06.904 --> 29:09.583
He takes his family to
Lijiang and passes by here.

29:09.584 --> 29:11.183
So they'll come by and play for some days.

29:11.184 --> 29:13.344
And he said,
don't disturb the village leaders.

29:14.704 --> 29:15.824
This is...

29:16.344 --> 29:17.504
a surprise attack.

29:18.464 --> 29:20.824
Before, they said it's a team.

29:21.104 --> 29:22.704
Now he brings his family.

29:23.384 --> 29:24.543
How to receive them?

29:24.544 --> 29:27.423
He already asked not to
disturb the village leaders.

29:27.424 --> 29:29.344
Don't receive them in the name of the village.

29:30.544 --> 29:31.624
The secretary is right.

29:31.984 --> 29:34.264
Previous reception process,
I'm afraid it's useless.

29:34.984 --> 29:37.543
Instead,
let's deal with the trick with a trick.

29:37.544 --> 29:38.784
Make a private reception.

29:39.184 --> 29:40.120
Me.

29:40.144 --> 29:41.143
Huang.

29:41.144 --> 29:42.823
And another my staff.

29:42.824 --> 29:44.943
Wherever they want to go,
we'll take them there.

29:44.944 --> 29:47.703
Whatever they want to see,
we'll take them to see.

29:47.704 --> 29:48.663
I agree.

29:48.664 --> 29:49.383
Yao.

29:49.384 --> 29:50.743
I'll count it on you.

29:50.744 --> 29:51.223
Okay.

29:51.224 --> 29:52.864
Okay, I'll wash my hair.

29:52.864 --> 29:54.264
Then I'll get the clothes from Ms. Xie.

29:54.264 --> 29:55.104
It should be finished.

29:55.104 --> 29:56.023
Don't.

29:56.024 --> 29:57.263
Just wear casual clothes.

29:57.264 --> 29:58.424
Just be clean.

29:58.664 --> 30:00.064
So I don't wear that clothes.

30:00.344 --> 30:01.823
It's a private trip.

30:01.824 --> 30:03.424
It's not appropriate
for you to dress so formally.

30:04.024 --> 30:05.024
Right.

30:05.184 --> 30:06.544
Then I'll wash my hair.

30:07.224 --> 30:08.983
I will also prepare it
and make arrangements.

30:08.984 --> 30:09.823
Go.

30:09.824 --> 30:11.063
Call us when necessary.

30:11.064 --> 30:11.943
Rest assured.

30:11.944 --> 30:12.944
Okay.

30:15.144 --> 30:16.304
A surprise attack?

30:18.704 --> 30:19.144
No.

30:19.144 --> 30:20.584
Today I planned to take Lingdang

30:20.584 --> 30:22.424
and my sister to the ancient city.

30:23.264 --> 30:24.264
It's okay.

30:25.064 --> 30:26.704
Let them travel freely.

30:27.904 --> 30:29.024
Okay, bye.

30:30.264 --> 30:31.264
What's the matter?

30:31.664 --> 30:34.383
The owner of Shaohua
Bookstore will come here today.

30:34.384 --> 30:35.824
He called before boarding.

30:36.264 --> 30:37.983
Why does everything come together?

30:37.984 --> 30:39.144
Exactly.

30:43.904 --> 30:44.904
Friends.

30:45.224 --> 30:46.224
I'm leaving.

30:46.784 --> 30:48.023
Do you leave now?

30:48.024 --> 30:49.023
I'm leaving.

30:49.024 --> 30:50.184
Where are you going?

30:50.744 --> 30:51.823
Beijing.

30:51.824 --> 30:53.704
To attend Live House.

30:54.344 --> 30:55.663
Didn't you watch the group chat?

30:55.664 --> 30:57.904
Damai keeps talking about her dog in the group.

30:58.904 --> 30:59.904
Damai.

31:00.264 --> 31:03.104
She has left,
but she's more active than when she was here.

31:03.504 --> 31:05.063
She never stops talking in the group.

31:05.064 --> 31:06.504
Come on, hurry up.

31:06.744 --> 31:07.744
Okay.

31:07.904 --> 31:08.903
I'm leaving.

31:08.904 --> 31:10.464
I'll bring you Daoxiang Village back.

31:10.824 --> 31:12.744
Just remember to bring yourself back.

31:13.464 --> 31:14.103
Goodbye.

31:14.104 --> 31:15.104
Goodbye.

31:18.784 --> 31:19.784
Lingdang.

31:20.584 --> 31:21.264
Have your breakfast.

31:21.264 --> 31:22.704
Aunt has a task today.

31:27.464 --> 31:28.744
Here they are.

31:40.024 --> 31:40.944
You are Huang, right?

31:40.944 --> 31:41.344
Yeah.

31:41.344 --> 31:41.944
Hello.

31:41.944 --> 31:42.920
Hello, Assistant Zhang.

31:42.944 --> 31:43.943
Baby.

31:43.944 --> 31:45.183
Be careful.

31:45.184 --> 31:46.144
Let me introduce.

31:46.144 --> 31:47.343
This is Mr. Liu.

31:47.344 --> 31:48.904
This is Mr. Liu's wife, Jing.

31:49.144 --> 31:49.983
Hello, Huang.

31:49.984 --> 31:50.904
Hello, Mr. Liu and JIng.

31:50.904 --> 31:51.224
Hello.

31:51.224 --> 31:52.984
This is the entrepreneur
who comes back to our village,

31:52.984 --> 31:54.343
Xie Zhiyao, Mr. Xie.

31:54.344 --> 31:55.423
Hello, Mr. Liu.

31:55.424 --> 31:56.383
Don't call Mr. Liu.

31:56.384 --> 31:57.064
I'm older than you.

31:57.064 --> 31:58.064
Just call me Liu.

31:58.344 --> 31:59.344
Alright, Liu.

31:59.744 --> 32:00.904
This is Xu Hongdou.

32:00.904 --> 32:02.423
She's our volunteer.

32:02.424 --> 32:03.184
Liu and Jing.

32:03.184 --> 32:04.223
Just call me Xu.

32:04.224 --> 32:05.984
This is the cold brew tea from Mr. Xie's store.

32:05.984 --> 32:06.704
Have a taste.

32:06.704 --> 32:07.703
The trip must be tiring.

32:07.704 --> 32:08.384
Just give it to you.

32:08.384 --> 32:09.143
Thank you.

32:09.144 --> 32:09.664
Thank you.

32:09.664 --> 32:10.943
Xu, don't be ceremonious.

32:10.944 --> 32:14.023
This time,
we are on a private trip.

32:14.024 --> 32:15.783
So, let's not talk about work.

32:15.784 --> 32:17.223
We only stay for one day.

32:17.224 --> 32:19.983
Tomorrow morning,
We'll go to Lijiang.

32:19.984 --> 32:21.143
Sure.

32:21.144 --> 32:22.424
Your family travels here.

32:22.424 --> 32:24.023
Just be our guest.

32:24.024 --> 32:25.544
Let's enjoy delicacies and have fun.

32:26.184 --> 32:27.224
Then sorry to bother you.

32:27.224 --> 32:28.224
Not at all.

32:28.224 --> 32:29.824
We're very happy that you came.

32:30.624 --> 32:32.344
Is there a stroller
in the trunk?

32:32.344 --> 32:33.183
Yes.

32:33.184 --> 32:33.823
Here.

32:33.824 --> 32:34.343
Okay.

32:34.344 --> 32:35.024
Thanks Thanks.

32:35.024 --> 32:35.424
You're welcome.

32:35.424 --> 32:36.624
Then I'll take you to the homestay first

32:36.624 --> 32:38.103
and visit the ancient town later.

32:38.104 --> 32:38.543
Okay.

32:38.544 --> 32:39.544
Okay.

32:40.464 --> 32:43.703
This town is only one
kilometer away from our village.

32:43.704 --> 32:46.624
The tourists here can just
walk casually to our village.

32:47.024 --> 32:47.903
So near.

32:47.904 --> 32:48.904
Yes.

32:48.984 --> 32:52.383
Last year,
the road outside was renovated and widened.

32:52.384 --> 32:54.183
It was a single line before.

32:54.184 --> 32:57.103
During the farming season,
when two harvesters meet,

32:57.104 --> 32:58.664
they had to cross the
field to drive through.

32:59.704 --> 33:01.863
Your house is very distinctive.

33:01.864 --> 33:03.023
There are traces of time.

33:03.024 --> 33:03.863
Yeah.

33:03.864 --> 33:05.183
It's all old houses.

33:05.184 --> 33:06.784
After we made protective improvements,

33:06.784 --> 33:08.064
it still retains its original style.

33:08.064 --> 33:09.984
Now it's exactly like what it was before.

33:15.864 --> 33:17.863
Why do you come here to volunteer?

33:17.864 --> 33:18.864
Me?

33:19.064 --> 33:20.103
I'm here on holiday.

33:20.104 --> 33:21.263
I'll stay for many months.

33:21.264 --> 33:25.344
Since I'm staying here,
I just help to do what I can do.

33:26.384 --> 33:27.384
Do you like here?

33:28.184 --> 33:29.743
The weather is fine here.

33:29.744 --> 33:31.343
There are clouds in the daytime.

33:31.344 --> 33:32.783
There are stars at night.

33:32.784 --> 33:34.344
The interpersonal relationship is simple.

33:35.464 --> 33:36.464
Yes.

33:36.544 --> 33:37.784
I feel the same way.

33:39.064 --> 33:40.744
Then come and invest here.

33:42.864 --> 33:44.143
I'm just an assistant.

33:44.144 --> 33:45.144
I'm not in charge.

33:50.784 --> 33:52.224
The road is rough. Be careful.

33:52.224 --> 33:53.224
Okay.

33:59.504 --> 34:00.624
That one looks good.

34:01.144 --> 34:02.424
Yes.

34:03.624 --> 34:06.304
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

34:06.584 --> 34:09.423
♫ I pick some mushrooms ♫

34:09.424 --> 34:11.944
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket ♫

34:11.944 --> 34:14.624
♫ I take out a pen ♫

34:14.624 --> 34:17.863
♫ The pen leaks ink ♫

34:17.864 --> 34:20.783
♫ What can I do ♫

34:20.784 --> 34:25.144
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

34:29.184 --> 34:32.063
♫ Mung beans are delicious ♫

34:32.064 --> 34:34.703
♫ Gingers are tender ♫

34:34.704 --> 34:37.583
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

34:37.584 --> 34:40.304
♫ They pile up like a tower ♫

34:40.544 --> 34:43.383
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

34:43.384 --> 34:46.223
♫ With a slim figure ♫

34:46.224 --> 34:47.984
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

34:47.984 --> 34:48.343
Come on.

34:48.344 --> 34:49.624
Friends from afar.

34:49.624 --> 34:51.143
A toast to you with tea instead of wine.

34:51.144 --> 34:52.144
Thank you.

34:52.144 --> 34:52.744
Cheers.

34:52.744 --> 34:53.744
Thank you.

34:56.224 --> 34:57.224
Huang.

34:57.344 --> 34:58.584
Last time you sent that promotional video.

34:58.584 --> 34:59.903
It's really attractive.

34:59.904 --> 35:01.223
It shows the cultural atmosphere.

35:01.224 --> 35:02.343
The scenery is also beautiful.

35:02.344 --> 35:03.320
Yeah.

35:03.344 --> 35:05.183
All actors are from our village.

35:05.184 --> 35:07.104
If I don't see you,
I thought you invited

35:07.104 --> 35:08.104
professional actors.

35:08.664 --> 35:10.943
But the first time we meet
Xu Hongdou and Mr. Xie,

35:10.944 --> 35:12.624
I thought you two
are a real couple.

35:13.264 --> 35:14.543
No.

35:14.544 --> 35:16.623
That's the need of the plot.

35:16.624 --> 35:17.440
Yes.

35:17.464 --> 35:19.544
Xu Hongdou is just a tourist here.

35:20.824 --> 35:22.023
How long have you been here?

35:22.024 --> 35:23.024
More than two months.

35:24.944 --> 35:25.344
Yes.

35:25.344 --> 35:26.943
Do you really like this place?

35:26.944 --> 35:28.064
She likes it here.

35:29.384 --> 35:31.223
There is your spokesman here.

35:31.224 --> 35:32.744
Let her say it, okay?

35:35.424 --> 35:36.064
Actually,

35:36.064 --> 35:38.783
I came here
because it's a relatively unpopular place.

35:38.784 --> 35:41.464
In other places,
there are too many people, too crowded.

35:41.744 --> 35:42.704
When searching online,

35:42.704 --> 35:45.343
all places seem to be visited by everyone.

35:45.344 --> 35:46.023
Right?

35:46.024 --> 35:47.344
The photos they took are similar.

35:47.344 --> 35:49.263
There is no freshness at all.

35:49.264 --> 35:49.983
Yes.

35:49.984 --> 35:51.944
An unpopular place has
relatively more space.

35:52.384 --> 35:54.823
Actually, at first,
I didn't have such great hopes.

35:54.824 --> 35:56.784
After all, it is an unpopular place.

35:57.064 --> 35:59.744
There must be a reason for its unpopularity.

36:00.344 --> 36:02.183
When I arrived, I found that,

36:02.184 --> 36:03.823
in terms of development and planning,

36:03.824 --> 36:07.544
compared with other developed popular villages,

36:07.544 --> 36:09.144
it's really slower.

36:09.464 --> 36:12.863
They've actually accumulated popularity.

36:12.864 --> 36:14.383
It's like a restaurant.

36:14.384 --> 36:15.983
The more people queue at the door,

36:15.984 --> 36:18.184
isn't it that more people are willing to queue?

36:18.544 --> 36:20.343
What about the new restaurant?

36:20.344 --> 36:22.103
Actually, it needs some publicity

36:22.104 --> 36:25.144
and a signature dish
that can be presented at the door.

36:25.744 --> 36:26.720
Yes.

36:26.744 --> 36:27.744
Signature dish.

36:28.704 --> 36:31.343
This restaurant should match the dishes.

36:31.344 --> 36:32.904
Like a Fish Head with Chopped Pepper

36:32.904 --> 36:34.223
matches Hunan Restaurant.

36:34.224 --> 36:36.424
Boiled Fish should be in Sichuan Restaurant.

36:36.824 --> 36:38.224
And so on, right?

36:38.224 --> 36:39.704
Here comes the dish.

36:41.264 --> 36:42.024
Come and make room.

36:42.024 --> 36:42.903
Here.

36:42.904 --> 36:44.183
Sour Papaya Fish.

36:44.184 --> 36:44.863
Thank you, Aunt Hua.

36:44.864 --> 36:45.423
You're welcome.

36:45.424 --> 36:45.744
Enjoy.

36:45.744 --> 36:50.424
Also,
the Sour Papaya Fish must be in Yunnan Restaurant.

36:50.424 --> 36:50.864
Right?

36:50.864 --> 36:52.263
Of course.

36:52.264 --> 36:53.344
Come on, Liu and Jing.

36:53.344 --> 36:54.103
Try it.

36:54.104 --> 36:56.264
The Sour Papaya Fish
is completely different from other places.

36:56.264 --> 36:57.424
See if you like it.

37:02.224 --> 37:03.224
Alright.

37:04.184 --> 37:05.504
It's beautiful.

37:05.984 --> 37:06.984
Come on.

37:07.064 --> 37:08.183
Okay.

37:08.184 --> 37:09.504
Change your pose.

37:10.664 --> 37:11.664
Okay.

37:21.104 --> 37:22.983
Our head office is
in Xicheng District.

37:22.984 --> 37:24.424
Which hotel do you want to go to later?

37:24.704 --> 37:25.743
I'm not in a hurry.

37:25.744 --> 37:27.104
Before I go back to Beijing,

37:27.104 --> 37:28.664
I'll spend some time with my parents.

37:29.984 --> 37:30.984
Sure.

37:31.104 --> 37:32.104
Actually, me too.

37:32.344 --> 37:33.704
I don't have much time to go home.

37:35.264 --> 37:36.264
Xu Hongdou.

37:37.584 --> 37:38.584
Come here.

37:40.824 --> 37:41.984
Excuse me.

37:48.984 --> 37:49.984
What's the matter?

37:54.384 --> 37:55.384
What are you talking about?

37:55.384 --> 37:56.624
You keep talking.

37:57.504 --> 37:58.824
He got various problems.

37:58.824 --> 37:59.664
Curious about everything.

37:59.664 --> 38:00.424
And talkative.

38:00.424 --> 38:01.424
Just chatting.

38:02.104 --> 38:03.104
Specifically?

38:03.704 --> 38:04.944
When did I come?

38:04.944 --> 38:06.304
What do I like here?

38:06.664 --> 38:08.144
How about the folkway?

38:08.424 --> 38:09.944
What did you do before?

38:09.944 --> 38:11.344
Why do you invest here?

38:11.344 --> 38:12.504
How is the business?

38:12.984 --> 38:14.904
Then what is fun nearby?

38:15.344 --> 38:16.664
Are there many tourists here?

38:25.624 --> 38:27.023
What about Mr. Liu and his wife?

38:27.024 --> 38:28.103
What did they say?

38:28.104 --> 38:28.880
Play.

38:28.904 --> 38:29.880
Take photos.

38:29.904 --> 38:30.904
Don't ask anything.

38:34.024 --> 38:36.224
No wonder this guy is aiming at you.

38:46.424 --> 38:48.623
I think there's something wrong.

38:48.624 --> 38:52.583
In the hotel industry,
I've met so many traveling guests.

38:52.584 --> 38:54.183
There's no assistant

38:54.184 --> 38:56.944
who talks more than the boss during the meal.

38:59.504 --> 39:00.504
Check him.

39:01.344 --> 39:02.824
But I don't know his full name.

39:03.184 --> 39:04.224
He added me to WeChat.

39:04.984 --> 39:06.464
He... He added you to WeChat?

39:10.904 --> 39:13.184
Shaohua Bookstore, Zhang Mingyu.

39:14.784 --> 39:16.464
Zhang Mingyu.

39:18.264 --> 39:19.504
There really is a man named Zhang Mingyu

39:19.504 --> 39:20.064
in Baidu Encyclopedia.

39:20.064 --> 39:21.144
Is it him?

39:21.624 --> 39:24.304
Chief designer of Shaohua Bookstore.

39:35.344 --> 39:36.544
What should we do next?

39:38.984 --> 39:40.143
Know yourself and your enemy.

39:40.144 --> 39:41.184
Be invincible in a hundred battles.

39:41.504 --> 39:42.624
He tricks you.

39:42.944 --> 39:43.944
You trick him back.

39:46.944 --> 39:47.944
Okay.

39:48.544 --> 39:49.864
Whether there are dates or not,

39:50.144 --> 39:51.424
try to hit them down.

39:52.464 --> 39:53.464
Come on.

40:00.504 --> 40:01.504
I count on you.

40:02.624 --> 40:03.664
Okay.

40:04.024 --> 40:05.024
I try my best.

40:23.984 --> 40:25.264
Go back and have a good sleep.

40:25.264 --> 40:26.543
Don't think about anything.

40:26.544 --> 40:27.863
They leave early tomorrow morning.

40:27.864 --> 40:29.664
We've done everything we need to do.

40:30.584 --> 40:32.343
Stop thinking. I'm out of power.

40:32.344 --> 40:33.783
Let's review it tomorrow.

40:33.784 --> 40:35.943
Thanks for sending me home today.

40:35.944 --> 40:36.503
Bye.

40:36.504 --> 40:36.903
Bye.

40:36.904 --> 40:37.224
Bye.

40:37.224 --> 40:38.424
Be careful.

40:42.544 --> 40:43.544
Let's go.

40:46.944 --> 40:48.503
Sorry for today.

40:48.504 --> 40:50.264
You should have been with your sister.

40:50.704 --> 40:51.704
No.

40:52.184 --> 40:52.984
Even if I had accompanied her,

40:52.984 --> 40:54.664
she would just have kept talking on the phone.

41:02.024 --> 41:03.024
Are you okay?

41:06.344 --> 41:07.344
There is a pit.

41:09.784 --> 41:10.784
There is a pit.

